[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 2404.31, "timestamp": "00:40:04", "text": "。 だから、私にはその"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2407.51, "timestamp": "00:40:07", "text": "経験がないんです。それに、私が"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2410.069, "timestamp": "00:40:10", "text": "これを"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2413.71, "timestamp": "00:40:13", "text": "真剣に考えているかどうか、実際に"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2416.23, "timestamp": "00:40:16", "text": "競争心を持って真剣に取り組んでいるかどうかにもよります。というのも、私の場合、やりたいと思った時、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2429.91, "timestamp": "00:40:29", "text": "今はやらなくてもいい、などと言って自分を制限してしまったことがあったからです。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 2431.621, "timestamp": "00:40:31", "author": "@kronosMonke", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/u5R_PAWdwUdS05VsH3X9UsOPhhDkvp9L56mdw35mAubmJfUNuvcEeYcJ70Z5Hh_SFtAZe4NL2w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "i experienced something like this. i followed a creator. they assured me they would fullfill me wish of watching them play a horror game. they betrayed me"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 2442.656, "timestamp": "00:40:42", "author": "@kronosMonke", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/u5R_PAWdwUdS05VsH3X9UsOPhhDkvp9L56mdw35mAubmJfUNuvcEeYcJ70Z5Hh_SFtAZe4NL2w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "competitive cuz they see it as a business"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2450.87, "timestamp": "00:40:50", "text": "私が説明したように、こういうこともあります。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2452.95, "timestamp": "00:40:52", "text": "これは、彼らが"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2455.069, "timestamp": "00:40:55", "text": "再び私の期待に応えてくれていることを確信させてくれた。 彼らは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2457.75, "timestamp": "00:40:57", "text": "それをビジネスと捉えているため、非常に競争心が強かった"}]